msgctxt "search2:search2_20B7F719_A77B_4C98_AE25_384AFDFEB29B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“You’re all drinking witch blood!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫« Vous buvez tous du sang de sorcière ! »"

#: search2:search2_0ED2EBDE_430F_424C_BB84_9A6CCC54C9D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 269163c7c0d0b4b76f0830f862f05bb0050504f86976b7388533291371b569c8
#. default-sha256: 2a15bc0e7f7bb902aee191d63508ff2f5a2dc197c371c86c699fa891bbc923c7
msgctxt "search2:search2_0ED2EBDE_430F_424C_BB84_9A6CCC54C9D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Crushed by the loss of his only family,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫the young man picked up a silver "
"fork,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫and plunged it into his own throat,⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫ending his life.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Naturally, there was an uproar. ⟪k:15⟫Goblets of wine crashed against the earth "
"in rapid succession ⟪k:16⟫as the people holding them fell to the ground and vomited or convulsed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dévasté par la perte de son unique famille,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫le jeune homme s’empara d’une "
"fourchette en argent,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫la plongea dans sa propre gorge⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫et mit ainsi "
"fin à ses jours.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Naturellement, cela déclencha un véritable tollé. ⟪k:15⟫"
"Les gobelets de vin s’écrasèrent au sol les uns après les autres ⟪k:16⟫tandis que les gens qui "
"les tenaient tombaient par terre et vomissaient ou avaient des convulsions."

#: search2:search2_512A7DE4_CCC0_4DBB_A2B1_57FC9D21C9DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd1238a1b26e0cb698a6e7da1d87fdf302fe2f8053d4f41a6c1fc0e17c89a231
#. default-sha256: fd935e94f195bb099739e22f4f08d096236dbfc937d744baa6350e9abeafe4f0
msgctxt "search2:search2_512A7DE4_CCC0_4DBB_A2B1_57FC9D21C9DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And he looked down upon it all from the safety of the observation tower. ⟪k:2⟫He could "
"do nothing but watch as his domain burned. ⟪k:3⟫I can only imagine how painful that must have "
"been.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫But before long, having seemingly have made his peace, he began descending "
"the spiral staircase. ⟪k:7⟫He opened the door at the bottom, revealing himself to his people.⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫But before the door had swung all the way open—⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫before he had "
"had a chance to say his final words—⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫someone ran a blade through his chest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il contempla tout cela à l’abri, du haut de sa tour d’observation. ⟪k:2⟫Il ne pouvait "
"rien faire d’autre, si ce n’est regarder son domaine brûler. ⟪k:3⟫Je ne peux qu’imaginer la "
"souffrance qu’il a dû ressentir.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Mais rapidement, la conscience visiblement en "
"paix, il commença à descendre l’escalier en spirale. ⟪k:7⟫Il ouvrit la porte du bas et se révéla "
"à ses sujets.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Mais avant que la porte ne fût entièrement ouverte —⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫avant même qu’il ait eu la chance de prononcer ses dernières paroles —⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫quelqu’un lui enfonça un coup d’épée dans la poitrine."

#: search2:search2_F93C46F0_5ABF_46D2_B67A_CB6F268B8FD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4e9ef70c768bbfef974c035ddbc5970c11bc61a610da713303b9bfce5ef6115
#. default-sha256: d4b5a197074f61116cd6e972a4e9e47261832ce6dc2187b093a92acaecac11e2
msgctxt "search2:search2_F93C46F0_5ABF_46D2_B67A_CB6F268B8FD0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫In less than a week, ⟪k:2⟫the entire city was dead."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫En moins d’une semaine, ⟪k:2⟫toute la ville était morte."

#: search2:search2_F7FE30AB_96EA_4033_8751_05E485BA8BF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3298a2817850e774ed17e0146154d75dc45ce1269716c8ab9c5199df6d0e9eac
#. default-sha256: 5ee2c72bbe01e7591c1e63d8ac3817581f40330e72a760aa43d397b5f3e440af
msgctxt "search2:search2_F7FE30AB_96EA_4033_8751_05E485BA8BF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s possible...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫that⟪k:6⟫ was no miracle either.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫You "
"can easily explain what happened to them.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Locked away for so long in that dirty "
"tower, maybe I caught some kind of disease. ⟪k:13⟫And then, when the people drank my blood, they "
"too were infected. ⟪k:14⟫Hardly anything out of the ordinary about that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il est possible...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...que cela non plus n’ait pas été un miracle.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫On peut aisément expliquer ce qui leur est arrivé.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Peut-être qu’en étant "
"enfermée si longtemps dans cette tour abjecte, j’avais attrapé une maladie. ⟪k:11⟫Et qu’après, "
"quand les gens burent mon sang, ils se retrouvèrent infectés eux aussi. ⟪k:12⟫Rien "
"d’extraordinaire là-dedans."

#: search2:search2_E5F8CCFB_DD57_4BFB_B819_ABA67E64CFC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6563ae6b99e53e71e23b9fcd698fa2ef00e87ecf2e482cf8033b0535ecbdaff7
#. default-sha256: 53dc8f9623e2ae0c0d5c9606325d329112adc8615c9ea67fcaedfd74aa5fd833
msgctxt "search2:search2_E5F8CCFB_DD57_4BFB_B819_ABA67E64CFC6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The first to die, the girl, had already been ill. ⟪k:2⟫Her body merely chose the worst "
"possible time to yield to her ailment. ⟪k:3⟫That was all that had happened.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Indeed...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫It was nothing more than a fluke. ⟪k:11⟫An improbable stroke of luck. "
"⟪k:12⟫An unbelievably unfortunate accident for the city and those three men—and an indescribably "
"fortunate accident for myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La première à mourir, la fille, était déjà malade. ⟪k:2⟫Son corps avait simplement "
"choisi le pire moment possible pour s’incliner face à la maladie. ⟪k:3⟫Voilà tout.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Eh oui...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ce n’était rien de plus qu’un hasard. ⟪k:11⟫Un improbable coup de "
"chance. ⟪k:12⟫Un malheureux accident pour la ville et pour ces trois hommes, et un heureux hasard "
"pour moi — aussi incroyable que cela puisse paraître."

#: search2:search2_1A9627D9_FB02_4D50_B56E_83F2795B45B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3430d6d5f1c227eed412a37b6891d0e211545503649706d403041d7e83ef3f9b
#. default-sha256: 00e9043101a2e7f28d4dbeaf958cf366192a94a3c37afd5aef149d01a1c4d0a2
msgctxt "search2:search2_1A9627D9_FB02_4D50_B56E_83F2795B45B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫My curse had brought death upon the three men, ⟪k:6⟫but for "
"whatever reason... ⟪k:7⟫my rancor was far from sated.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫They had died. ⟪k:11⟫So what?"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Death is but a transient agony.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫It’s nothing compared to what "
"I went through."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ma malédiction avait provoqué la mort des trois hommes, ⟪k:6⟫mais "
"pour une raison que j’ignore... ⟪k:7⟫ma rancœur était loin d’être apaisée.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ils "
"étaient morts. ⟪k:11⟫Et alors ?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫La mort n’est qu’une souffrance passagère.⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Ce n’est rien comparé à ce que j’ai vécu."

#: search2:search2_257E9F43_4644_4F36_BE58_C450D9C14FDE
